msgid "Pix32v6 Flight Controller"
msgstr "Pix32v6 飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v6.rst:6
#: 113d415c4513407880391f99c4ef47d6
msgid ""
"Pix32v6 is a variant of the Holybro Pixhawk 6C. It is comprised of a "
"separate flight controller and carrier board which are connected by a 100 "
"pin connector. It is designed for those pilots who need a high power, "
"flexible and customizable flight control system."
msgstr ""
"Pix32v6 是 Holybro Pixhawk 6C 的变体版本。由独立的飞控和底板组成，通过 100 "
"针连接器相连。专为需要高性能、灵活且可定制飞控系统的飞手设计。"

